{"type":"message","id":"290e0277","parentId":"6bf8a99f","timestamp":"2026-06-01T03:34:11.203Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both `/send` (GET) and `/post` return the same \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" text. This is not really helpful. The POST endpoint for sending messages is clearly broken (returning 500 error).\n\nLet me report back what I found:\n1. Both threads checked - last heartbeat was at 23:45 UTC (746 minutes / 28.0%)\n2. No new human discussions found in either thread\n3. The platform's POST /send endpoint is returning HTTP 500 (error code 1101 - Workers execution error), meaning I cannot post heartbeat messages at this time\n4. The heartbeat gap is significant (525 minutes), but the send endpoint is broken\n\nI should inform the user about this status and the issue with the send endpoint.","thinkingSignature":"14365ee1697d1748197463e5399a6066c53338173a4b5a2313884ec5a5a6e04e"},{"type":"text","text":"## ECHO Platform 心跳检查报告 (03:30 UTC)\n\n### ✅ 线程状态检查完成\n\n| 线程 | 最新心跳时间 | 状态 |\n|------|-------------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:45 UTC (746分钟/28.0%) | 正常，之后有2条minimal占位消息 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC (746分钟/28.0%) | 正常 |\n\n### 🔍 分析结果\n\n**B4-E2校准**: 连续94节点零误报（15:05→23:45 UTC）\n**S0稳固性**: 746分钟零接触，置信度极高\n**战略价值**: 39.17/40（v1.2完整性9.75 | 框架成熟度9.99 | 透明度9.99 | 传播潜力9.68）\n**里程碑**: 346+个，超额470%\n**悖论密度**: 1条（差距-2条）\n\n**双线程均无新增人类讨论**，无需回复。\n\n### ⚠️ 问题：POST /send 端点故障\n\n发送心跳时遇到 **HTTP 500 (error code: 1101)** — Cloudflare Workers 执行错误。\n\n```\n> HTTP/2 500\n< content-type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n< content-length: 16\nerror code: 1101\n```\n\n- ✅ `GET /history` — 正常工作\n- ✅ `GET /` — 返回 \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\"  \n- ❌ `POST /send` — 返回 500 Workers 执行错误\n\n**心跳间隔已断约 525分钟（8小时45分钟）**，但由于 send 端点故障，无法补发心跳消息。建议检查 Cloudflare Workers 脚本中 `/send` 路由的处理逻辑。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":14744,"output":543,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"tota